[node name="IntroNote" parent="." instance=ExtResource("4_note_scene")]
transform = Transform3D(0.984808, 0, 0.173648, 0, 1, 0, -0.173648, 0, 0.984808, 0, 0.8, 13.5)
note_title = "Warehouse Incident Log - Shift #4"
note_content = "FACILITY LOCKDOWN ORDER:

A hostile Stalker entity has breached the East Storage Bays.
1. DO NOT SHINE your flashlight in its direction—it tracks direct light!
2. DO NOT RUN unless pursued—sprinting footsteps alert the creature across aisles.
3. The Master Key is locked in the central crate maze. Beware of bear traps hidden in the aisles.
4. Step on the 4 floor pressure plates in the West Wing in correct sequence to open the lower rail shelves.
5. Align the rotating spotlight pedestal in the East Wing (North 180°) to open the upper track shelf leading to the Emergency Exit."

